"uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_1114552525676893_1677870913491985454_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JQ2c-xdjDNMQ7kNvwEWwe5H&_nc_oc=Adq2qeYWKWDQQCYWAPG82sl9rsOyioifj1B3ibCrbuh6TMkFtM5oDXTT1_ku8DC5bjk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4hDh6cHCDCh7sxDJ8Q3I3ORCweeMLT33BzKol-cAHvPw&oe=6A1AD8C7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "be a superhuman cover image.png", "id": "942148429692825", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974499_942148433026158_7347930193473508401_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PngcQ3hiSd4Q7kNvwF_Mmwp&_nc_oc=Adp3bbG7RBKc5S7yLW_XN3mKqplVOmpcwivwtoiHO0SV1HVS-Ym_EmLoCqQP4OYi9gE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4eYrN9PjqX1qxnlviZLMWP08PHNZodZeJNisl_zyLHMw&oe=6A1AE954"}, "display_name": "Villa", "keywords": ["among", "team", "fly", "social", "design"], "long_description": "* Standups, roadmapping, happy hours, board meetings, design, 1:1s, and offsites that are out of this world and far better than IRL\n* A creativity platform, much like Zoom + Slack in 3D. Our focus is teams, giving tech professionals superpowers to be their best\n* The answer to \u2018videoconference fatigue\u2019 by putting you in thrilling immersive meeting experiences, giving you the tools to interact, co-invent and play\n* A meeting in VR is multiples more effective than IRL meetings with massive screens, and activities that defy physics like drawing in the air\n* Launched with multiple locations around the world. At the heart of each such micro-universe is your Villa, always the same, and always unique as you personalize it to reflect your team and org\u2019s personality and identity\n* Boost in culture, the glue that holds everyone to a common mission which is tricky in remote\n* Improved camaraderie and positive workplace feelings\n* Big CapEx and OpEx savings to your company relative to 